<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel says sees 95 bln yen capex in 1996/97.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel says sees 95 bln yen capex in 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp said on Thursday that it estimated its capital investment in the year to March 31 at about 95 billion yen.  </p>
<p>Nippon Steel's actual capital spending in 1995/96 was 120 billion yen.</p>
</text>
